19	// providers (e.g. gemini) can't be routed through `claude --model` — the CLI
20	// speaks the Anthropic Messages API, not OpenAI chat-completions — so they're
21	// excluded here rather than surfaced as a picker option that fails at spawn
22	// time. (A direct, non-CLI API path for those is a possible future addition,
23	// not this one.)
